  "adaptations": [
    "Read-only synchronous start/retirement observation captures generation IDs before original handles disappear; solo has no observer",
    "Protocol14 bounded B2AU events over reliable Control, per-recipient baseline and 512-event budget",
    "Server natural completion retires the logical handle without cutting short delayed client one-shots; explicit stop cancels playback",
    "At most128 client voices; only naturally retired playback tails may be displaced by new logical voices",
    "Local player-owned sound is private; cinematic controller local and spatial/ambient sounds are broadcast",
    "Independent client asset readers, sample clocks and replica speaker positions; no server PCM/device or playback acknowledgement",
    "Animation-key sounds, announcement/VoiceMgr/music and cosmetic effect audio remain separate consumers"
  ]
